   "source": [
    "# PHASE 2A — REAL GEMMA INSTRUMENT VALIDATION\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook executes the 11-stage instrument validation suite on `google/gemma-2-2b-it` using Google Colab with a T4 GPU.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Scientific Objective\n",
    "Determine whether all newly implemented causal-intervention primitives (`target/gemma.py`, `interventions/sandbox.py`) function as intended on real Gemma weights:\n",
    "1. Software & Tensor Hook Correctness\n",
    "2. No-Op Intervention Stability ($\alpha=0.0$)\n",
    "3. Continuous Dose Response Curves\n",
    "4. Causal Specificity via Random Controls\n",
    "5. Bidirectional Patching\n",
    "6. Attribution / Localization Signal Evaluation\n",
    "7. Attention-Head Level Interventions (`patch_head`, `ablate_head`)\n",
    "8. MLP Block Level Interventions (`patch_mlp`, `ablate_mlp`)\n",
    "9. Component Comparison (Residual vs Attention Head vs MLP)\n",
    "10. Independent Replication\n",
    "11. Contrastive Control Specificity"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
